{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2021-06-02 08:00:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER TO SUPPLY INTEGRATED DRIVE MODULE TO HYUNDAI MOTOR GROUP ELECTRIC VEHICLES', 'text': "AUBURN HILLS, MICH., JUNE 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BORGWARNER'S INTEGRATED DRIVE MODULE (IDM) WAS SELECTED BY THE HYUNDAI MOTOR GROUP FOR ITS POWER ELECTRIC SYSTEM, WHICH WILL BE USED IN THE UPCOMING A-SEGMENT ELECTRIC VEHICLE PRODUCTION, PLANNED TO START IN MID OF 2023."}